This license (from https://github.com/OATML-Markslab/ProteinGym) applies to
the code in this wrapper that is vendored from, or derived from, the official
ProteinGym "AIDO" baseline (src/proteingym/models/aido_rag_16b/
vendor/misc.py, plus this wrapper's own model.py, which reimplements that
baseline's scoring algorithm against the evedesign API) and to all other
original code in this wrapper directory.

Two files vendored transitively from that baseline
(vendor/protein.py, vendor/residue_constants.py) originate further upstream
from DeepMind's AlphaFold and carry their own Apache License 2.0 header
(Copyright 2021 DeepMind Technologies Limited) at the top of each file - that
license governs those two files specifically; see
http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0 for the full text.

The model weights (genbio-ai/AIDO.Protein-RAG-16B-proteingym-dms-zeroshot and
genbio-ai/AIDO.StructureEncoder, both on HuggingFace) are NOT covered by this
license - they are distributed by GenBio AI under the GenBio AI Community
License Agreement, a separate, non-commercial-use license. See GENBIO_LICENSE
in this directory for the full text, and the "License" section of README.md
for a summary of its terms as they apply to this wrapper.
